      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Still happens in open beta (and now we can toggle legacy calibrate on the fly to illustrate the effect)\nI have found a public Nanachi with the issue too. Hopefully useful for testing. Avatar ID: avtr_e85cd98d-c4b2-4dcf-8430-8bed0791b036\nIn general all the affected avatars I've found have been small.\nVideo of the avatar: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/946881839400882196/1027915623558299688/2022-10-07_14-08-00.mp4",
